{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29886","headline":"寓怀 · 李商隐","name":"寓怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩鸾餐颢气，威凤入卿云。\n长养三清境，追随五帝君。\n烟波遗汲汲，矰缴任云云。\n下界围黄道，前程合紫氛。\n金书惟是见，玉管不胜闻。\n草爲回生种，香缘却死熏。\n海明三岛见，天迥九江分。\n搴树无劳援，神禾岂用耘。\n鬬龙风结阵，恼鹤露成文。\n汉岭霜何早，秦宫日易曛。\n星机抛密绪，月杵散灵氛。\n阳鸟西南下，相思不及羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}